Thursday's application is closed.
Coverage of Sunday's filing called it "another" appeal. The docket for 26A297, the Thursday filing, shows it withdrawn the same day 26A305 was docketed. Jackson's Sunday order is a response deadline of 4 p.m. on September 9. Why it matters: Sunday's application is 26A305; the Thursday application is not pending.
