What the coverage got right, and what it got wrong
Sunday's story ran on the Associated Press wire and on PBS and CNBC in that form, on CBS with a shorter "President Trump" line, and in separate writes at NBC and The Hill. Thursday's application had its own Hill, CBS, and NPR stories. The errors below are the ones the filings contradict.
