0019	The administration asks the Supreme Court to lift a new block on mail-ballot rules
0020	On Sunday the solicitor general filed application 26A305, asking the justices to pause a September 4 injunction of Postal Service ballot-mail rules. That injunction covers elections on or before November 3. Sunday's filing is 58 days before that election.
