        <p data-layer="narrative">The dates leave little room. The public record of this fight starts with the March 31 order. Sunday's stay request was filed {computed.daysFilingToElection} days before the election the injunction names, and {computed.daysFilingToJackson} days before Jackson's response deadline. September 19 is the UOCAVA statutory mailing date, {computed.daysFilingToUocava} days after the filing; the rule's "express exclusion of UOCAVA ballots" means that date is not a deadline this rule imposes.<Cite s="scotus-26a305-docket" passage="4 p.m. (EDT) on September 9, 2026." /><Cite s="usps-final-rule" passage="express exclusion of UOCAVA ballots" /></p>

