    64	ACTION: Final rule.
    65	SUMMARY: The Postal Service is
    66	
    67	amending the Mailing Standards of the
    68	United States Postal Service, Domestic
    69	Mail Manual, regarding the transmission
    70	of mail-in or absentee ballots for federal
    71	elections pursuant to its rulemaking
    72	authority.
    73	DATES: Effective August 21, 2026.
