The initial record review shows the story’s chosen beginning is too late. The final rule itself points back to the June 2 proposed rule, more than 200,000 comments, an interagency OMB review, and two injunctions already in place when USPS issued the rule. I am now testing whether those omitted records change the legal, operational, or causal frame.
