over new U.S. Postal Service mail ballot rules ",{"type":"a","content":["extended her block"],"attrs":{"href":"https://abcnews.com/Politics/federal-judge-temporarily-blocks-trump-administrations-attempt-restrict/story?id=136021374","target":"_blank","dir":"ltr"}}," of the rules for the November midterm elections in an order issued on Friday, again finding them likely unlawful."]},{"type":"p","content":["Judge Indira Talwani's temporary order, which had been set to expire on Sept. 10, is now in place indefinitely unless a higher court allows the Trump administration to put the rules into effect."," "]},{"type":"p","content":["The judge found that immediate implementation of the rules this close to the November election, prompted by President Donald Trump's"," ",{"type":"a","content":["executive order aimed at tightening access to mail ballots"],"attrs":{"href":"https://www-cdn.abcnews.com/Politics/trump-signs-executive-order-aimed-cracking-mail-voting/story?id=131592101","target":"_blank","dir":"ltr"}},", \"threatens disenfranchisement of millions of United States citizens who seek to vote by mail.\""]},{"type":"inline","content":{"name":"ContentPromo","props":{"cards":[{"headline":"Trump administration files urgent appeal with Supreme Court over USPS mail-in ballot rules","link":"https://abcnews.com/Politics/trump-administration-files-urgent-appeal-supreme-court-usps/story?id=136187030","isGMA":false,"type":"floating","inline":true,"image":null,"indicators":{"contentType":{"key":null,"ref":null,"props":{"icon":{"key":"general-arrowRight","paths":[{"d":"M0 14.398h26.006L17.361 5.42l2.309-2.221L32 16.001 19.67 28.799l-2.309-2.222 8.645-8.976H0v-3.203z","fill":"currentColor","clipRule":null,"fillRule":null}],"viewBox":"0 0 32 32","title":"Arrow Right"},"ariaLabel":null,"size":"1em","viewBox":"0 0 32 32"},"_owner":null}}}],"dividerEnabled":true,"recommendationId":"","recommendationList":"","recommendationMethod":"","trackingTitle":"related articles","type":"callout","style":{"IconsConfig":{"isArray":true,"arrayKey":"cards","propkey":"indicators.contentType","iconPath":"general.arrowRight","elementName":"ContentPromo","exceptionKey":"image"}}},"context":{},"config":{}}},{"type":"p","content":["Talwani concluded that the rules, which mandate nationwide mail ballot design and review requirements and state submission of a voter information database to USPS, are \"unconstitutional where it intrudes not only on Congress's"," "," Elections Clause powers but also that power left to the States.\""]},{"type":"p","content":["The decision ups the ante for the U.S. Supreme Court, which had ",{"type":"a","content":["already been asked to weigh in"],"attrs":{"href":"https://abcnews.com/Politics/trump-administration-files-urgent-appeal-supreme-court-usps/story?id=136187030","target":"_blank","dir":"ltr"}}," on Talwani's preliminary injunction. A decision is expected as soon as next week."," "]},{"type":"inline","content":{"name":"Ad","props":{"ad":{"kvps":{"pos":"fitt-article-inline-outstream-1"},"type":"fitt-article-inline-outstream","className":"fitt-article-inline-outstream"},"placeholders":{"compact":{"ratio":0.5625,"delay":1},"regular":{"ratio":0.5625,"delay":1}}},"context":{},"config":{}}},{"type":"p","content":["Time is of the essence since some states have already begun mailing ballots for the fall election."," "]},{"type":"inline","content":{"name":"Image","props":{"link":{},"caption":{"credit":"Hannah Beier/Reuters, FILE","text":"A mail-in ballot, during the Pennsylvania primary election, is displayed in Philadelphia, May 19, 2026.","lines":4,"showMoreAriaLabel":"Show More about Image Caption"},"image":{"alt":"","src":"https://i.abcnewsfe.com/a/999c6922-05ef-4f5f-a97d-8fa7cef59ff6/main-in-ballot-rt-jt-260826_1787768921307_hpMain.jpg","loading":"lazy","sources":[{"src":{"x1":"https://i.abcnewsfe.com/a/999c6922-05ef-4f5f-a97d-8fa7cef59ff6/main-in-ballot-rt-jt-260826_1787768921307_hpMain.jpg?w=375","x2":"https://i.abcnewsfe.com/a/999c6922-