   550	    “Mail-In and Absentee Participation List” (“Statewide List”).15 Separately, election
   551	    officials will need to upload a manifest into a parallel system (a legacy bulk mailing
   552	    system) for each batch of ballots a state submits to be mailed. At this stage USPS
   553	    will perform its first verification to confirm that the Intelligent Mail barcodes (“IMbs”
   554	    or “barcodes”) in the batch manifest match the ones in the statewide list.
