   918	Conclusion
   919	
   920	40.​Our client, a lawful anonymous whistleblower, has come forward to flag a
   921	    foreseeable catastrophic disruption to our coming nationwide elections based on
   922	    the reckless pursuit of readying a new, insufficiently tested, poorly planned mail-in
   923	    ballot screening system. As of the date of this disclosure, the USPS is aiming to
   924	    have this system ready for public release on September 1, 2026. Our client’s
   925	    concern that the new election ballot mail IT systems will crash the USPS processing
   926	    of mail ballots in the upcoming election cycle is only heightened by the repeated
   927	    failures of its components during the compressed development process. Moreover,
