  2779	A. Overview
  2780	To begin, the Postal Service is
  2781	continuing to accept and deliver ballot
  2782	mail, including Federal Ballot Mail,
  2783	from election officials and voters. The
  2784	proposed rule does not end or prevent
  2785	mail-in or absentee voting, contrary to
  2786	the mistaken claims raised in
  2787	comments. As explained above, the
  2788	Postal Service is continuing to carry out
