  2800	Mail for acceptance into the mailstream.
  2801	Thus, the final rule regulates Federal
  2802	Ballot Mail, consistent with the Postal
  2803	Service’s core statutory function, not the
  2804	franchise. Eligibility for mail-in and
  2805	absentee voting will continue to be
