  1471	authority that Congress has provided.” Nat’l Fed. of Indep. Bus. v. OSHA, 595 U.S. 109, 117
  1472	
  1473	(2022). In promulgating the Final Rule, the USPS claims authority stemming from Congress’s
  1474	
  1475	delegation of its legislative power to allow the USPS to do rulemaking “as may be necessary in
  1476	
  1477	the execution of its functions under this title.” 91 Fed. Reg. at 54971 (citing 39 U.S.C.
  1478	
  1479	§ 401(2)). 33
