  2452	
  2453	judicial review’ and relief is not granted as ‘a matter of right.’” Rhode Island, 155 F.4th at 41
  2454	
  2455	(quoting New York v. Trump, 133 F.4th 51, 65 (1st Cir. 2025)). The movants “bear the burden of
  2456	
  2457	demonstrating that they are entitled to the ‘extraordinary’ relief that they seek.” Id. (quoting
  2458	
  2459	Somerville Pub. Schs. v. McMahon, 139 F.4th 63, 68 (1st Cir. 2025)).
