   121	on the proposed revisions to Mailing
   122	Standards of the United States Postal
   123	Service, Domestic Mail Manual
   124	(‘‘DMM’’), incorporated by reference in
   125	the Code of Federal Regulations, set
   126	forth in the proposed rule. The
   127	comment period closed on July 2, 2026.
   128	To ensure the faithful execution of
   129	federal law in connection with federal
   130	elections, this rule has an immediate
   131	effective date. Delaying the effective
   132	date would jeopardize implementation
   133	of this rule in time for the 2026 general
   134	election, which will be held on
