src/pages/events/mail-voting/september-2026.astro-127-          <p>... the court finds, on one side, that immediate implementation of the Final Rule issued less than seventy days before the November 2026 election threatens disenfranchisement of millions of United States citizens who seek to vote by mail.<Cite s="talwani-pi-2026-09-04" passage="the court finds, on one side," /></p>
