   238	
   239	needed a procedure, and scanning equipment and protocols, for Postal Service clerks
   240	to perform a second round of verification, checking physical envelopes against the
   241	data in the Portal. Id. ¶¶ 3, 11–13. 6
   242	II. The verification procedures are designed to disenfranchise lawful
   243	voters.
